# tree-sitter-vue warning hardening fixes
# Created: 2025-11-02
# Upstream: https://github.com/ikatyang/tree-sitter-vue
# Commit: (vendored snapshot)
#
# Fixes:
#   1. -Wsign-compare: Cast delimiter operand to unsigned char in scan_raw_text
#   2. -Wimplicit-fallthrough: Add explicit break in '>' case of scan_comment
